231
00:09:05,519 --> 00:09:09,680
resolve the unknowns layer by layer.

232
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:12,000
Start with the outermost unknowns

233
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:15,279
represented as a right triangle. This is

234
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:17,279
a huristic idea. So follow the logic.

235
00:09:15,279 --> 00:09:19,120
In the limiting case, imagine the object

236
00:09:17,279 --> 00:09:21,600
support where an X-ray touches one

237
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:24,160
molecule, an extremely small element.

238
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:26,320
Take this as an example.

239
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:28,000
You have a small material element. You

240
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:30,640
know the incoming intensity, you know

241
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:32,399
the attenuated intensity. And because

242
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:34,560
the data are partitioned, you know the

243
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:36,240
total path length. From these three

244
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:38,399
