271
00:10:31,839 --> 00:10:35,120
Now you know the value here, you know

272
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:37,279
the value there, and you know the total

273
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:39,600
length. So you can resolve mu for this

274
00:10:37,279 --> 00:10:41,279
particular green triangular pixel.

275
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:44,160
Likewise, each of the green elements is

276
00:10:41,279 --> 00:10:46,720
resolved.

